invalid type: string "On-Premise\n\n\n\nOpen the workflow page from the AEM server URL.\n<AEM_Server_URL>:<port>/workflow\n\n\nOpen a workflow from the workflow page. For example, Review Topic.\n\n\nSelect Process Step from the Workflow section of the AEM dialog and drag-drop on the workflow.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nDouble-click the process and open the Step Properties dialog.\n\n\ntate of the docume